1137a10</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">III</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Adv.</span> <span class=\"gk\">σοφῶς</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">cleverly, wisely</b>, etc., first (?) in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> </span>(?)<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1122</span> </span>; then in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Alc.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">699</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ba.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1271</span> </span> codd., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Heracl.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">558</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ra.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1434</span> </span>, etc.: <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Comp.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">-ώτερον</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Hec.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1007</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Sup.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">-ώτατα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Hel.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1528</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Nu.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">522</span> </span>:—<span class=\"gk\">σοφῶς</span>, as an exclamation of applause, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plu.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.45f</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Mart.</span> <span class=\"lex-cit